  "source_to_consumer": [
    "The largest nonsingular leading Hankel block reads the support size from the measured prefix, including signed inputs whose degree-zero moment vanishes.",
    "Its actual inverse acts on the next measured column. The monic recurrence selects the original sites in the supplied available inventory. A second power-matrix inverse reads the measured weights.",
    "The native available inventory is the image of the complete stored actor table. Its remaining-budget clock is injective on those original points.",
    "Four rational moments read the difference of the two original adjacent integer materials and the original terminal. Integer restoration feeds the actual whole and next, and the independent original reached or exhausted consumer."
  ],
